Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why does a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,car window explode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:02.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,into tiny cubes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's tempered glass:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,heated red hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.51,0:00:06.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,then blasted with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:06.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,cold air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.21,0:00:07.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,The surface
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:08.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,hardens first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:09.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:11.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,cools, shrinks, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:11.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,squeezes the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:12.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,surface tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,That squeeze makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,it about four
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,times stronger than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:16.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,normal glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:17.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,But the energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,stays locked inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:19.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Break through the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:20.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,surface, and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:20.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,all lets go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:21.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Cracks race across
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:23.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pane at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,nearly a mile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:24.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,per second,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:25.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,leaving blunt little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:26.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,cubes instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:27.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,knife-like shards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.15,0:00:29.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Windshields\Nare different:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,glued to plastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:31.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,they crack but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:32.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,hold together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:33.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why emergency
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:34.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,hammers are made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:35.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,for side windows.
